VITE_API_URL=https://api.welte225.org

# The AI teacher (spoken feedback, lesson plans, spoken questions). Unset means
# the deployed app runs without it: the exaggerated counter-performance still
# plays, but nobody talks. Point this at the Node teacher service once it is
# behind HTTPS — see DEPLOYMENT.md. The deploy workflow can also supply it as a
# repository variable, which wins over this file.
# VITE_TEACHER_URL=https://api.welte225.org/teacher

# Optional prototype features, off unless set to 1 (see client/src/featureFlags.ts).
# Both can also be flipped per browser from the debug sidebar without a rebuild.
# VITE_TEACHER_AGENTIC=1
# VITE_TEACHER_VOICE=1
